AB  - The paper addresses the problem of accelerating the “tail” stage of a computational experiment in a Desktop Grid. We provide the mathematical model of a “tail” stage, describe the setting of simulation experiments and provide their results. Task replication in “tail” phase proves to be efficient in decreasing the duration of “tail” by orders of magnitude.
